<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="n_playout-definitions" targetNamespace="http://mira-miner/export"><bpmn:process id="n_playout" name="Play-out Model" isExecutable="false"><bpmn:task id="n_idbe5fccc8-c252-4c04-88c1-78e855bdbd51" name="run_function"><bpmn:documentation>instruction: run function validate and submit the budget interlock bot

user escalation: Nothing to ask — no parameter is set to vary.</bpmn:documentation><bpmn:incoming>n_c55888b8-8a2c-4c56-b7b7-9b85c617bbf0</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:outgoing>n_ec14c697-b901-4de6-8e69-d329fd739b47</bpmn:outgoing></bpmn:task><bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="n_idef1d8509-fe5d-49b5-b0b6-03d2711a6371" name="consult user"><bpmn:documentation>instruction: Choose the outgoing flow based on the user’s input.

user escalation: Ask user to choose any one of the possible outgoing flows: update again, run function</bpmn:documentation><bpmn:incoming>n_520ade93-d73d-4ab9-8d08-28b4b9b7629b</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:outgoing>n_e1cfaab3-087a-4e81-bfb6-2c01f69ef554</bpmn:outgoing><bpmn:outgoing>n_c55888b8-8a2c-4c56-b7b7-9b85c617bbf0</bpmn:outgoing></bpmn:exclusiveGateway><bpmn:startEvent id="n_id49def65c-6c70-4fd1-b92c-0f841b4953bb"><bpmn:outgoing>n_fc59ddab-5f25-4ee7-b77a-9a59a535269c</bpmn:outgoing></bpmn:startEvent><bpmn:endEvent id="n_idc234d44b-78aa-4c1a-8a2e-6983577b42c0"><bpmn:incoming>n_ec14c697-b901-4de6-8e69-d329fd739b47</bpmn:incoming></bpmn:endEvent><bpmn:task id="n_id51042dc4-0ba4-480a-ac1b-ff6cefdc35b5" name="retrieve"><bpmn:documentation>instruction: Produce the table for line item $line_item on sheet ALL ACCOUNTS 1H. It should return the four columns Modeled $ USD, Current Validated $ USD, Adjustment $ USD, Final Validated $ USD and the corresponding rows from the row label column Coverage Name.

user escalation: Which line item ($line_item)?
where:
$line_item : The identifier of the table (line item) to retrieve from the sheet.</bpmn:documentation><bpmn:incoming>n_fc59ddab-5f25-4ee7-b77a-9a59a535269c</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:outgoing>n_3104fabe-531b-4df8-b8de-6d0597e38d1d</bpmn:outgoing></bpmn:task><bpmn:task id="n_id1c601cfb-278b-4e7d-9435-50d952bacbc1" name="update"><bpmn:documentation>instruction: for row $row_key change the column Adjustment to value $new_value, responding to dialog messages $messages with dialog responses $dialog_chosen

user escalation: Which row ($row_key), value ($new_value), dialog responses ($dialog_chosen) and dialog messages ($messages)?
where:
$row_key : The row label identifying which entity&apos;s value is being updated.
$new_value : The new numeric value to set in the specified column for the specified row.
$dialog_chosen : The sequence of responses chosen for any confirmation or validation dialogs that appear during the update operation.
$messages : The sequence of dialog messages presented to the user during the update operation, including confirmation prompts and validation results.</bpmn:documentation><bpmn:incoming>n_10d40dcc-2b95-4046-b809-cb257806da66</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:outgoing>n_520ade93-d73d-4ab9-8d08-28b4b9b7629b</bpmn:outgoing></bpmn:task><bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="n_idc12494ea-c948-4843-96ca-60b8768a70ae"><bpmn:incoming>n_e1cfaab3-087a-4e81-bfb6-2c01f69ef554</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:incoming>n_3104fabe-531b-4df8-b8de-6d0597e38d1d</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:outgoing>n_10d40dcc-2b95-4046-b809-cb257806da66</bpmn:outgoing></bpmn:exclusiveGateway><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="n_ec14c697-b901-4de6-8e69-d329fd739b47" sourceRef="n_idbe5fccc8-c252-4c04-88c1-78e855bdbd51" targetRef="n_idc234d44b-78aa-4c1a-8a2e-6983577b42c0"/><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="n_520ade93-d73d-4ab9-8d08-28b4b9b7629b" sourceRef="n_id1c601cfb-278b-4e7d-9435-50d952bacbc1" targetRef="n_idef1d8509-fe5d-49b5-b0b6-03d2711a6371"/><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="n_fc59ddab-5f25-4ee7-b77a-9a59a535269c" sourceRef="n_id49def65c-6c70-4fd1-b92c-0f841b4953bb" targetRef="n_id51042dc4-0ba4-480a-ac1b-ff6cefdc35b5"/><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="n_e1cfaab3-087a-4e81-bfb6-2c01f69ef554" sourceRef="n_idef1d8509-fe5d-49b5-b0b6-03d2711a6371" targetRef="n_idc12494ea-c948-4843-96ca-60b8768a70ae" name="update again"/><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="n_c55888b8-8a2c-4c56-b7b7-9b85c617bbf0" sourceRef="n_idef1d8509-fe5d-49b5-b0b6-03d2711a6371" targetRef="n_idbe5fccc8-c252-4c04-88c1-78e855bdbd51" name="run function"/><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="n_10d40dcc-2b95-4046-b809-cb257806da66" sourceRef="n_idc12494ea-c948-4843-96ca-60b8768a70ae" targetRef="n_id1c601cfb-278b-4e7d-9435-50d952bacbc1"/><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="n_3104fabe-531b-4df8-b8de-6d0597e38d1d" sourceRef="n_id51042dc4-0ba4-480a-ac1b-ff6cefdc35b5" targetRef="n_idc12494ea-c948-4843-96ca-60b8768a70ae"/></bpmn:process><bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="n_playout-diagram"><bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="n_playout-plane" bpmnElement="n_playout"><bpmndi:BPMNShape id="n_idbe5